From: hockinglee <hockinglee@gmail.com>
Subject: cli_classic: Add --ignore-size to write/verify images smaller than the flash

Adds --ignore-size (-w/-v with images smaller than the flash) and
--read-size (-r of only the first N bytes) to the classic CLI.

